ly a member of the militia of [one of] the several states? (Might I ask that you please refrain from pursuing this off-topic aside any further?)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7040859676780889156/comments/default/6171160416025963407'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7040859676780889156/comments/default/6171160416025963407'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/08/war-partys-new-torchlight-parade.html?showComment=1282072649872#c6171160416025963407' title=''/><author><name>Free Forester</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05957414837617216970</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='17' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_5f1CIyj4JT8/S6UHLaE5upI/AAAAAAAAAAM/-jzjZPO6TP4/S220/paladin.bmp'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/08/war-partys-new-torchlight-parade.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7040859676780889156' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7040859676780889156' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1231270022"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2010 at 1:17 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1165384254279077386</id><published>2010-08-16T20:49:54.884-06:00</published><updated>2010-08-16T20:49:54.884-06:00</updated><title type='text'>@Free Forester, why is the location inappropriate?...</title><content type='html'>@Free Forester, why is the location inappropriate?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If by &amp;quot;our C-in-C&amp;quot;, you Commander in Chief, please note that we, the U.S. citizens, do not have a C-in-C, but rather a president.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='ht